* Translation of words - save in db
* Search word for translation in saved words
* Built in translation into buryat by open source app or AI model
* Name, avatar of user
* Pair other devices for the same user
* Roles, administator of language can assign roles to others
  * Administrator of language - can do anything in language
  * Vote closer - can close votes
  * Word creator - can add new words to translation database
  * Banned to create vote
  * Banned to comment
* Comments on vote
* Open last opened language
* Study plans (Courses):
  * Creation of exercises, steps
  * Studying by student(user), progress, correct/wrong
